UID:city-sanfrancisco-2025-02-28@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250301
SUMMARY:San Francisco\, CA: Annual Business Tax Return due
DESCRIPTION:Annual filing deadline\, earlier than the typical April 15 patt
 ern | San Francisco's Annual Business Registration and Tax Return for tax y
 ear 2025 must be submitted and paid by March 2\, 2026 to avoid late penalti
 es - notably earlier than the April 15 pattern most other jurisdictions use
 . San Francisco has no separate individual wage-earner income tax\; this is
  a business/gross-receipts tax that can apply to self-employed individuals.
  | Authority: Direct fetch of the Treasurer & Tax Collector's Annual Busine
 ss Registration and Tax Form Instructions this session | Source: https://sf
 treasurer.org/annual-business-registration-and-tax-form-instructions-25-27 
 | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-
 announced change\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
